  "description": "SkyrimNet Messageless Immersion is an SKSE plugin that turns game events,\nstatus changes, notifications, and events from supported mods into immersive\nSkyrimNet player thoughts. (ASDF)\n\nThis Hub entry links to the complete mod download. The full mod is required\nbecause it contains the native SKSE DLL, ESP, Papyrus scripts, configuration,\nand SkyrimNet trigger definitions.\n\nDownload and install the latest release with your mod manager.\n\nList of mods that may benefit to varying degrees from the plugin: YPS fashion, MME Milk mod, Advanced Nudity Detection, SLSF, Battlefuck, BodySearch, Unforgiving Devices / Unforgiving Skyrim, Devious Followers, SLAC, SL Survival 0.685 Beta SE, STA v4.8 BETA SE, The Ancient Profession, Jailrape, Licenses - Player Oppression, Apropos 2, iNeed, RND and some elements from basic Skyrim.\nThe detailed links can be found in the README on the GitHub page.",
